{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_17","type":"agent_message","text":"The cross is indeed reversible: submitted after entering the 4×4 left dock, it grows the avatar back to exactly the dock footprint. That still does not reward immediately, so the dock is a staging condition rather than the whole goal. I’m checking whether docking activates the remote actor—first via ordinary directions, then via bounded one-to-three-cell panel commands—using remote-shape change as the dense measure."}}
